1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:09,414
Namaste!

2
00:00:09,454 --> 00:00:13,415
Medoro Pharmacy ke is tutorial mein aapka swagat
hai.

3
00:00:13,455 --> 00:00:18,775
Is part mein hum dekhenge ki Medoro par apna
account kaise banate hain,

4
00:00:18,815 --> 00:00:23,002
use verify kaise karte hain, aur login kaise
karte hain.

5
00:00:23,775 --> 00:00:27,037
Sabse pehle browser mein medoro.in kholiye.

6
00:00:27,077 --> 00:00:30,184
Upar menu mein Pharmacy par click kijiye.

7
00:00:30,954 --> 00:00:34,671
Yahan Medoro Pharmacy ke saare features, pricing

8
00:00:34,711 --> 00:00:41,403
aur data security ki jaankari hai: billing,
inventory, GST, accounts aur AI assistant.

9
00:00:44,578 --> 00:00:49,670
Ab upar daayin taraf 'Start 7-day free trial'
button par click kijiye.

10
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:54,509
Saat din ka trial bilkul free hai, aur koi card
nahi maanga jaata.

11
00:00:55,268 --> 00:00:57,082
Yeh asli sign-up page hai.

12
00:00:57,122 --> 00:01:01,573
Yahan aap Google account se ya email se sign up
kar sakte hain.

13
00:01:02,343 --> 00:01:07,746
Dhyan dijiye: is video ke liye hum ek alag demo
server istemaal kar rahe hain,

14
00:01:07,786 --> 00:01:11,095
taaki kisi asli pharmacy ka data na chhua jaaye.

15
00:01:11,135 --> 00:01:15,352
Demo server par Medoro ka bilkul yahi software
chal raha hai,

16
00:01:15,392 --> 00:01:17,864
aur ismein saara data kaalpanik hai.

17
00:01:18,612 --> 00:01:23,552
Email se sign up karne ke liye apna email
address daaliye aur 'Send code' dabaaiye.

18
00:01:24,328 --> 00:01:28,944
Medoro aapke email par chhah ankon ka
verification code bhejta hai,

19
00:01:28,984 --> 00:01:31,307
jo das minute tak valid rehta hai.

20
00:01:31,347 --> 00:01:36,936
Email se code dekhkar yahan daaliye, aur
'Confirm and continue' par click kijiye.

21
00:01:37,702 --> 00:01:39,308
Email confirm ho gaya!

22
00:01:39,348 --> 00:01:43,349
Ab pharmacy ki details bharne wala form khul
gaya hai.

23
00:01:43,389 --> 00:01:47,540
Yeh onboarding hum agle part mein step by step
bharenge.

24
00:01:49,610 --> 00:01:54,348
Ab dekhte hain ki login aur account ki suraksha
kaise kaam karti hai.

25
00:01:54,388 --> 00:01:56,425
Pehle hum sign out karte hain.

26
00:01:57,183 --> 00:02:00,291
Sign in page par apna email aur password
daaliye.

27
00:02:06,899 --> 00:02:11,528
Owner aur manager ke account par two-step
verification zaroori hai.

28
00:02:11,568 --> 00:02:15,778
Authenticator app mein dikh raha chhah ankon ka
code daaliye.

29
00:02:15,818 --> 00:02:20,517
Agar phone paas na ho, to recovery code bhi
istemaal kar sakte hain.

30
00:02:20,557 --> 00:02:24,976
Apne counter PC ko tees din ke liye trusted bhi
bana sakte hain.

31
00:02:25,731 --> 00:02:27,496
Bas, aap andar aa gaye.

32
00:02:27,536 --> 00:02:31,105
Ab password bhool jaane ki sthiti dekhte hain.

33
00:02:31,145 --> 00:02:35,028
Sign out karke 'Forgot password' par click
kijiye.

34
00:02:35,777 --> 00:02:39,611
Apna registered email daaliye aur 'Send code'
dabaaiye.

35
00:02:39,651 --> 00:02:43,625
Medoro us email par chhah ankon ka reset code
bhejta hai,

36
00:02:43,665 --> 00:02:46,301
jo pandrah minute tak valid rehta hai.

37
00:02:47,044 --> 00:02:52,025
Email se code dekhkar yahan daaliye, phir naya
password do baar likhiye.

38
00:02:52,065 --> 00:02:57,256
Dhyan dijiye: password badalte hi aap har device
se sign out ho jaate hain,

39
00:02:57,296 --> 00:03:01,510
aur login par two-step verification phir bhi
laagu rehta hai.

40
00:03:02,823 --> 00:03:04,178
Password badal gaya.

41
00:03:04,218 --> 00:03:08,990
Ab naye password aur authenticator code se
dobara sign in karte hain.

42
00:03:19,974 --> 00:03:25,094
Security ke liye yaad rakhiye: password kam se
kam das characters ka rakhiye,

43
00:03:25,134 --> 00:03:27,976
recovery codes offline sambhaalkar rakhiye,

44
00:03:28,016 --> 00:03:33,672
aur paanch baar galat password daalne par
account kuch der ke liye lock ho jaata hai.

45
00:03:33,712 --> 00:03:36,353
Medoro mein koi default login nahi hota.

46
00:03:42,416 --> 00:03:46,497
Is part mein hum pharmacy ka onboarding poora
karenge.

47
00:03:46,537 --> 00:03:53,364
Upar chhah steps dikh rahe hain: Pharmacy, Your
account, Branches, Team, Backups aur Done.

48
00:03:54,125 --> 00:03:56,578
Pehla field hai pharmacy ka naam.

49
00:03:56,618 --> 00:04:00,506
Wahi naam likhiye jo aapke bill par chhapna
chahiye.

50
00:04:00,546 --> 00:04:03,527
Hum likh rahe hain Medoro Demo Pharmacy.

51
00:04:04,272 --> 00:04:05,573
Ab GSTIN daaliye.

52
00:04:05,613 --> 00:04:11,645
GSTIN pandrah characters ka hota hai, aur Medoro
uska format check karta hai.

53
00:04:11,685 --> 00:04:17,323
Dekhiye, agar hum adhoora GSTIN daalein, to
Continue par error aata hai.

54
00:04:18,076 --> 00:04:20,176
Ab poora GSTIN daalte hain.

55
00:04:20,216 --> 00:04:25,090
Is demo ka GSTIN aur drug licence number, dono
kaalpanik hain.

56
00:04:25,130 --> 00:04:30,163
Drug licence yaani Form 20B aur 21B ka number
zaroori field hai,

57
00:04:30,203 --> 00:04:33,017
kyunki yeh har bill par chhapta hai.

58
00:04:33,791 --> 00:04:37,392
Registered pharmacist ka naam aur registration
number,

59
00:04:37,432 --> 00:04:42,584
aur pharmacy ka poora address bhi bhariye, city,
state aur PIN code ke saath.

60
00:04:43,325 --> 00:04:46,821
Pharmacy code aapke staff ke login ke liye hai.

61
00:04:46,861 --> 00:04:52,690
Counter par staff yeh code, apna employee ID aur
PIN daalkar login karte hain.

62
00:04:52,730 --> 00:04:57,656
Interface language baad mein bhi badal sakte
hain: English, Hindi,

63
00:04:57,696 --> 00:05:00,064
ya English ke saath Hinglish AI.

64
00:05:00,822 --> 00:05:02,791
Continue par click kijiye.

65
00:05:02,831 --> 00:05:04,954
Agla step hai owner account.

66
00:05:04,994 --> 00:05:10,826
Medoro mein koi default login nahi hota: yeh
account pharmacy ka maalik hai,

67
00:05:10,866 --> 00:05:13,221
aur baaki sabko yahi jodta hai.

68
00:05:13,962 --> 00:05:17,056
Owner ka naam aur mobile number daaliye.

69
00:05:17,096 --> 00:05:19,799
Email pehle hi verify ho chuka hai.

70
00:05:19,839 --> 00:05:25,832
Password kam se kam das characters ka rakhiye,
aur use dobara confirm kijiye.

71
00:05:26,593 --> 00:05:28,459
Ab branches aur counters.

72
00:05:28,499 --> 00:05:34,177
Pehli branch ka naam Main Road rakhte hain, aur
usmein do billing counters.

73
00:05:34,217 --> 00:05:37,912
Phir Kanke Road naam ki doosri branch jodte
hain.

74
00:05:38,677 --> 00:05:44,773
Team step mein aap staff ko invite kar sakte
hain: manager, pharmacist, cashier,

75
00:05:44,813 --> 00:05:46,537
accountant ya delivery.

76
00:05:46,577 --> 00:05:49,758
Manager ko email se invite karna hota hai.

77
00:05:49,798 --> 00:05:53,516
Har invite code adtaalees ghante valid rehta
hai.

78
00:05:55,897 --> 00:05:56,675
Ab backups.

79
00:05:56,715 --> 00:06:02,175
Medoro mein pharmacy ka data aapke apne Google
Drive mein rakha jaata hai,

80
00:06:02,215 --> 00:06:06,188
aisi key se encrypt karke jo sirf aapke paas
hoti hai.

81
00:06:06,228 --> 00:06:11,317
Recovery kit download karke use offline,
surakshit jagah par rakhiye.

82
00:06:12,067 --> 00:06:17,574
Dono checkbox tick kijiye: recovery kit
sambhaalkar rakhne wala, aur Terms

83
00:06:17,614 --> 00:06:19,374
aur Privacy policy wala.

84
00:06:19,414 --> 00:06:22,597
Phir 'Create my pharmacy' par click kijiye.

85
00:06:23,344 --> 00:06:24,926
Pharmacy taiyaar hai!

86
00:06:24,966 --> 00:06:29,327
Yahan pharmacy code aur team ke invite codes
dikhte hain.

87
00:06:29,367 --> 00:06:32,725
Agla zaroori step hai two-step verification.

88
00:06:33,476 --> 00:06:36,930
'Set up two-step verification' par click kijiye.

89
00:06:36,970 --> 00:06:41,224
Apne phone ke authenticator app se yeh QR code
scan kijiye.

90
00:06:41,264 --> 00:06:46,174
Video mein QR code aur key suraksha ke liye
dhundhle kiye gaye hain.

91
00:06:46,937 --> 00:06:50,949
App mein dikh raha chhah ankon ka code daaliye
aur Verify kijiye.

92
00:06:52,667 --> 00:06:55,145
Ab das recovery codes dikhte hain.

93
00:06:55,185 --> 00:06:59,588
Phone kho jaane par har code ek baar login ke
kaam aata hai.

94
00:06:59,628 --> 00:07:04,328
Inhein download karke offline rakhiye; yeh
dobara nahi dikhenge.

95
00:07:05,077 --> 00:07:07,253
Aakhri setup hai Drive storage.

96
00:07:07,293 --> 00:07:16,187
Live Medoro mein pehle aap apna Google Drive
connect karte hain; is demo server par Google
Drive ka ek test version juda hai.

97
00:07:16,227 --> 00:07:19,046
'Set up Drive storage' par click kijiye.

98
00:07:19,807 --> 00:07:24,377
Medoro encryption keys aur ek Drive recovery
code banata hai.

99
00:07:24,417 --> 00:07:28,080
Yeh code naye device par data kholne ke liye
hai,

100
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:31,330
aur Medoro ke paas iski koi copy nahi hoti.

101
00:07:31,370 --> 00:07:33,295
Ise bhi surakshit rakhiye.

102
00:07:34,068 --> 00:07:37,960
Ab 'Start my pharmacy on this device' par click
kijiye.

103
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:42,177
Aapki medicines, stock, bills aur customers isi
device par,

104
00:07:42,217 --> 00:07:46,180
aur encrypted roop mein aapke Google Drive mein
rahenge.

105
00:07:46,954 --> 00:07:51,238
Onboarding poora ho gaya, aur dashboard khul
gaya hai!

106
00:07:51,278 --> 00:07:52,840
Abhi sab khaali hai.

107
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:58,446
Agle parts mein hum medicines, stock, suppliers
aur customers jodenge.
